matrix-rust-sdk
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Parts of the encryption layer here follow matrix-rust-sdk, which is the
reference client-side implementation of Matrix end-to-end encryption and the
primary consumer of vodozemac. Where logic is derived from it, the derivation is
noted at the point it appears.

  https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-rust-sdk
  Copyright 2020-2026 The Matrix.org Foundation C.I.C.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

matrix-rust-sdk carries no NOTICE file of its own, so there is nothing further
to propagate under section 4(d) of the License.

