On Fractal
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Fractal is a GTK Matrix client which is useful to read for how a client drives
encryption, and it appears in no part of this product. It is licensed
GPL-3.0-or-later, which is incompatible with the Apache License this work is
distributed under, so no code or comment may be copied from it. Reading it to
learn which operations a flow needs is fine; carrying its expression across is
not.
